      "reasoning": "For q-73860, a horizontal tangent plane requires f_x=3x^2-3=0 and f_y=2y+2=0. Thus x=±1 and y=-1; substitution gives (-1,-1,1) and (1,-1,-3). For q-37982, the normal (3y,3x-1/y,-1) must be parallel to (3,5,-1). Their identical nonzero third components force the proportionality factor to be 1, so y=1, x=2, and z=6. This is the unique solution. Both answers agree with their respective captured worked solutions.",
